# Small barrel voxel model, 6x6x8 voxels, 4 feet per voxel.
DIM 6 6 8
SCALE 4

# Ring template per layer: a filled disc with a slightly darker rim,
# repeated up the stack with a lighter mid-bulge band.

# z=0 (base rim)
V 1 1 0 0x5a3a1e
V 2 1 0 0x5a3a1e
V 3 1 0 0x5a3a1e
V 4 1 0 0x5a3a1e
V 1 2 0 0x5a3a1e
V 2 2 0 0x6a4a2a
