V 4 3 0 0x5a3a1e
V 1 4 0 0x5a3a1e
V 2 4 0 0x5a3a1e
V 3 4 0 0x5a3a1e
V 4 4 0 0x5a3a1e

# z=1..6: repeat a wider "belly" ring, bulging outward toward the middle
